  The full square artwork lives in design/app-icon.svg and in the legacy
  mipmap PNGs. For an adaptive icon the system only shows the centre ~66dp of
  this 108dp canvas, so the colour circles are anchored outside the corners and
  bleed into the visible mask instead of being cropped away.
-->
